error[E0925]: postulate `plusZero` is not allowed with --safe
 --> tests/neg/p1_safe_postulate.hgn:8:1
  |
8 | plusZero : (n : nat) -> eqn (plus n 0) n = %postulate. (*~ E0925 *)
  | ^^^^^^^^ an axiom: a constant without a value
  |
  = note: a postulate can assume anything, also a false statement; --safe accepts only proved ones
